    {
      "title": "Llama 2-Chat은 SFT 한 번 뒤<br>RLHF를 여러 번 반복해 만들었습니다",
      "body": "<p>§3 도입은 전체 그림(Fig. 4)을 보여 줍니다. 사전학습 모델에 SFT를 한 번 하고, 이후 선호 수집 → reward model → 정책 갱신을 V1부터 V5까지 반복합니다.</p><p>오늘은 사전학습을 뺀 네 단계를 순서대로 봅니다.</p>",
      "visual": "<figure style=\"width:100%;max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1120 360\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Llama 2 → SFT 후, 선호 수집 → RM → 정책 갱신 루프를 V1부터 V5까지 반복해 Llama 2-Chat\"><defs><marker id=\"ah2\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#5B6578\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahb\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#2E55A5\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"395\" y=\"18\" width=\"560\" height=\"324\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#2E55A5\" fill-opacity=\"0.05\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"675\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#2E55A5\" font-weight=\"700\">RLHF 루프 · V1 → V5 (5번)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"140\" width=\"150\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#F1F3F6\" stroke=\"#C9D1DE\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1B2230\">Llama 2</text><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"202.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5B6578\">사전학습</text><rect x=\"205\" y=\"140\" width=\"150\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#EEF3FC\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"280.0\" y=\"176.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1B2230\">SFT</text><text x=\"280.0\" y=\"202.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5B6578\">§3.1 · 한 번</text><rect x=\"425\" y=\"50\" width=\"210\" height=\"84\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#EEF3FC\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"530.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1B2230\">선호 수집</text><text x=\"530.0\" y=\"114.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5B6578\">§3.2.1 · 매주</text><rect x=\"715\" y=\"50\" width=\"210\" height=\"84\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#EEF3FC\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"820.0\" y=\"88.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1B2230\">Reward model</text><text x=\"820.0\" y=\"114.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5B6578\">§3.2.2 · 도움/안전</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"222\" width=\"210\" height=\"84\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#EEF3FC\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"260.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1B2230\">정책 갱신</text><text x=\"675.0\" y=\"286.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5B6578\">§3.2.3 · RS → PPO</text><rect x=\"985\" y=\"222\" width=\"125\" height=\"84\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#EAF5EF\" stroke=\"#2B7A57\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1047.5\" y=\"260.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1B2230\">Llama 2</text><text x=\"1047.5\" y=\"286.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#5B6578\">-Chat</text><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"203\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#5B6578\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2)\"/><path d=\"M355,180 C390,180 395,92 423,92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5B6578\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2)\"/><line x1=\"635\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"713\" y2=\"92\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#ahb)\"/><path d=\"M820,136 C820,185 750,180 740,220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#ahb)\"/><path d=\"M568,264 C520,264 500,200 520,136\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2E55A5\" stroke-width=\"3\" marker-end=\"url(#ahb)\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2E55A5\">새 모델로</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#2E55A5\">다시 수집</text><text x=\"675\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"40\" fill=\"#2E55A5\">↻</text><line x1=\"780\" y1=\"264\" x2=\"983\" y2=\"264\" stroke=\"#2B7A57\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2)\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#5B6578\">V5 완료</text></svg></figure>",
      "note": "3절은 Llama 2에서 Llama 2-Chat을 만드는 과정 전체입니다. SFT는 한 번만 하고, 그 뒤로 선호 데이터 수집, reward model 학습, 정책 갱신을 한 바퀴로 해서 여러 번 돕니다. 오늘은 이 네 단계를 순서대로 봅니다.",
